            "review_title": "Review at Green Vibes Nha Trang Cafe Hookah Bar",
            "review_text": "Marina K\n3 contributions\n1\nCozy, small establishment\nMay 2024 • Couples\nThere's a fairly large selection of drinks, from coffee to alcoholic cocktails. They also have fruit drinks like smoothies and freshly squeezed juices.\n\nThe menu includes breakfast items, burgers, poke, and desserts. They also offer hookahs.\n\nHot and cold drinks are available, which is not so common. I ordered unusual black noodles and a cappuccino; the noodles were very tasty. I also tried the buckwheat with chicken; the portion was very large for me personally ☺️ and very delicious.\n\nI waited for my dish for about 20 minutes. They immediately brought me a glass of cool water. Prices are average, I would even say not expensive.\n\nThere are board games; I saw some people playing. There's also a PS4 with a couch where you can sit and play if you like ☺️\nRead more\nWritten May 23, 2024\nDanis M\nThank you for your kind review! We're thrilled you enjoyed the drinks and dishes😊.\n\nWe look forward to seeing you again soon!\nRead more\nWritten October 1, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
